    "description": "Nankai Tatsumura Construction Co., Ltd. engages in the construction, design, and real estate businesses in Japan. The company is involved in structural and architectural design, construction management, and delivering of buildings, such as commercial, medical and welfare, public, educational and cultural facilities, and apartments; and home renovation business. It also engages in road, river, tunnel, and water and sewage facility construction; residential land development; land preparation work; redevelopment project; and maintenance work. In addition, the company is involved in track laying, signals and communications, electrical equipment, and seismic reinforcement; replacing rails and sleepers; fixing rail distortions; and seismic reinforcement. The company was founded in 1944 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan. Nankai Tatsumura Construction Co., Ltd. is a subsidiary of Nankai Electric Railway Co., Ltd."
